{"id":"0dcbdd8ee6906204","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/236_KP_+_Infinity.md","title":"236 KP + Infinity","display":"236_KP_+_Infinity","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> 只有二元关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>，没有常元；项只有变量项。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\doteq,\\quad \\in,\\quad \\neg,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\forall .\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\doteq,\\quad \\in,\\quad \\neg,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\forall .\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}(X)\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 外最小下标变量。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项、公式与结构操作\">2. 项、公式与结构操作</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\)</span> 的最小集合。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\)</span> 是由下列五个构造子生成的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t,s\\in t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\">\\(s\\doteq t,s\\in t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\">\\(\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists,\\forall x\\in a,\\exists x\\in a\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists,\\forall x\\in a,\\exists x\\in a\\)</span> 均由这些构造子展开；其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\vee B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\wedge(B\\to A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\vee B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\wedge(B\\to A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in a\\,A:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A),\\qquad\n\\exists x\\in a\\,A:=\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in a\\,A:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A),\\qquad\n\\exists x\\in a\\,A:=\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自由变量函数包含以下子句：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{KPInf}:\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{KPInf}:\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(s\\in t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(s\\in t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}^{KPInf}:\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{KPInf}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}^{KPInf}:\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{KPInf}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项约束变量集为空；等词与成员原子的约束变量集为空；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span> 保持，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span> 取并，并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{KPInf}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{KPInf}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{KPInf}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{KPInf}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{T}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{T}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{F}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{F}\\)</span>。项替换子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{T}:\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{T}:\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{F}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{F}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\doteq v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\doteq v[x:=s]),\n\\quad\n(u\\in v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\in v[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\doteq v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\doteq v[x:=s]),\n\\quad\n(u\\in v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\in v[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\quad\n(A\\to B)[x:=s]=A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\quad\n(A\\to B)[x:=s]=A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yB)[x:=s]=\\forall yB\\quad(y=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yB)[x:=s]=\\forall yB\\quad(y=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yB)[x:=s]=\\forall y(B[x:=s])\\quad(y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yB)[x:=s]=\\forall y(B[x:=s])\\quad(y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yB)[x:=s]=\\forall z((B[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=s])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yB)[x:=s]=\\forall z((B[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=s])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\">\\(y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{KPInf}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^{KPInf}\\)</span> 是兼容等词、成员、否定、蕴含和全称公式并包含全称绑定变量合法改名对的所有等价关系之交。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{KPInf}(A,x,y):=\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{F}(A,x,\\operatorname{var}(y)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{KPInf}(A,x,y):=\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{F}(A,x,\\operatorname{var}(y)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{KPInf}(\\forall xA,x,y):=\n\\forall y(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]),\n\\quad y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{KPInf}(\\forall xA,x,y):=\n\\forall y(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]),\n\\quad y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"有界量词的本地参数域\">有界量词的本地参数域</h2>\n<p>本篇成员有界量词是派生缩写，合法输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in \\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\">\\(a\\in \\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in \\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\">\\(A\\in \\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin \\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{KPInf}(a)\">\\(x\\notin \\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{KPInf}(a)\\)</span>。其范围项先作为自由参数给定，随后量词只绑定矩阵中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 和Levy有界量词闭包子句都只取满足这个条件的输入；例如界项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\)</span> 时该同名绑定显示式不获本篇有界形成许可。原始无界量词闭包不受这个额外限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本地宏接口与辅助绑定变量\">本地宏接口与辅助绑定变量</h2>\n<p>以下宏的实参是项；定义式左侧的名字是元变量占位符，不是预先固定的对象变量。辅助绑定变量先改名，随后同时代入实参。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Empty},\\operatorname{Inductive}:\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}^{1}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Empty},\\operatorname{Inductive}:\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}^{1}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Succ}:\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Succ}:\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对合法实参项组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t=(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\">\\(\\bar t=(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\)</span> 及其公式参数；令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为全部公式参数的自由变量集合之并（没有公式参数时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\varnothing\">\\(F=\\varnothing\\)</span>），定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X=\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{KPInf}(t_i)\\cup F\\cup R,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X=\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{KPInf}(t_i)\\cup F\\cup R,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 是显式指定的绑定角色变量的有限集。辅助绑定变量依骨架中从左到右的量词出现位置编号，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z_0=\\operatorname{fresh}(X),\\qquad z_{j+1}=\\operatorname{fresh}(X\\cup\\{z_i:i\\le j\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z_0=\\operatorname{fresh}(X),\\qquad z_{j+1}=\\operatorname{fresh}(X\\cup\\{z_i:i\\le j\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>把第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 个辅助量词及其绑定出现改为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_j\">\\(z_j\\)</span>；参数占位出现保持不变。嵌套宏自内向外展开，内层的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 并入外层已选的绑定角色。每次展开有限且所有辅助变量互异、避开实参自由变量。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-$\\Delta_0$-与无穷谓词\">3. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 与无穷谓词</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{KPInf}\">\\(\\Delta_0^{KPInf}\\)</span> 是包含原子公式、对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span> 闭合、并对成员有界量词闭合的最小类。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\subseteq b:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to x\\in b),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\subseteq b:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to x\\in b),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Empty}(e):=\\forall x\\neg(x\\in e),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Empty}(e):=\\forall x\\neg(x\\in e),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Succ}(x,y):=\\forall z(z\\in y\\leftrightarrow(z\\in x\\vee z\\doteq x)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Succ}(x,y):=\\forall z(z\\in y\\leftrightarrow(z\\in x\\vee z\\doteq x)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inductive}(I):=\\exists e(\\operatorname{Empty}(e)\\wedge e\\in I)\\wedge\n\\forall x(x\\in I\\to\\exists y(\\operatorname{Succ}(x,y)\\wedge y\\in I)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inductive}(I):=\\exists e(\\operatorname{Empty}(e)\\wedge e\\in I)\\wedge\n\\forall x(x\\in I\\to\\exists y(\\operatorname{Succ}(x,y)\\wedge y\\in I)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-逻辑公理与规则关系\">4. 逻辑公理与规则关系</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}^{KPInf}_{Log}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}^{KPInf}_{Log}\\)</span> 是下列七族的并集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\},\n\\quad\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\},\n\\quad\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\},\n\\quad\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\},\n\\quad\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\},\n\\quad\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\},\n\\quad\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\},\n\\quad\n\\{(s\\doteq t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\},\n\\quad\n\\{(s\\doteq t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{KPInf}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{KPInf}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{KPInf}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{KPInf}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{KPInf}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},A\\equiv_\\alpha^{KPInf}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{KPInf}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},A\\equiv_\\alpha^{KPInf}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下固定单例使用互异代表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=v_0,b=v_1,x=v_2,y=v_3,p=v_4,u=v_5,e=v_6,I=v_7,T=v_8\">\\(a=v_0,b=v_1,x=v_2,y=v_3,p=v_4,u=v_5,e=v_6,I=v_7,T=v_8\\)</span>。所有分离模式取该矩阵域中的全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 及互异 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(a,b,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>；所有收集模式（包括目标Sigma收集）取全部合法矩阵及互异 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(a,b,x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，并保留各集合构造式中结果 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 避开矩阵FV的条件。若本篇出现集合归纳，则其指定被替变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(z\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，辅助参数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(A)\\cup\\{z\\}),\\qquad x=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(A)\\cup\\{z,a\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(A)\\cup\\{z\\}),\\qquad x=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(A)\\cup\\{z,a\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这两辅助变量用于SetInd生成式的全部对应位置。它们互异且不捕获矩阵中任何其余参数；矩阵替换使用已定义Sub，不是字面替换。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-KP-部分公理\">5. KP 部分公理</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}=\\{\\forall a\\forall b(\\forall x(x\\in a\\leftrightarrow x\\in b)\\to a\\doteq b)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}=\\{\\forall a\\forall b(\\forall x(x\\in a\\leftrightarrow x\\in b)\\to a\\doteq b)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}=\\{\\exists e\\,\\operatorname{Empty}(e)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}=\\{\\exists e\\,\\operatorname{Empty}(e)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}=\\{\\forall a\\forall b\\exists p\\forall x(x\\in p\\leftrightarrow(x\\doteq a\\vee x\\doteq b))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}=\\{\\forall a\\forall b\\exists p\\forall x(x\\in p\\leftrightarrow(x\\doteq a\\vee x\\doteq b))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}=\\{\\forall a\\exists u\\forall x(x\\in u\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in a\\wedge x\\in y))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}=\\{\\forall a\\exists u\\forall x(x\\in u\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in a\\wedge x\\in y))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}=\\{\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\in a\\wedge A)):A\\in\\Delta_0^{KPInf},b\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(A)\\cup\\{a,x\\}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}=\\{\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\in a\\wedge A)):A\\in\\Delta_0^{KPInf},b\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(A)\\cup\\{a,x\\}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Coll}=\\{\\forall a((\\forall x\\in a\\,\\exists yA)\\to\\exists b\\forall x\\in a\\,\\exists y\\in b\\,A):A\\in\\Delta_0^{KPInf},b\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(A)\\cup\\{a,x,y\\}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Coll}=\\{\\forall a((\\forall x\\in a\\,\\exists yA)\\to\\exists b\\forall x\\in a\\,\\exists y\\in b\\,A):A\\in\\Delta_0^{KPInf},b\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(A)\\cup\\{a,x,y\\}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SetInd}=\\{(\\forall a((\\forall x\\in a\\,A[z:=x])\\to A[z:=a]))\\to\\forall aA[z:=a]:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},z\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SetInd}=\\{(\\forall a((\\forall x\\in a\\,A[z:=x])\\to A[z:=a]))\\to\\forall aA[z:=a]:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},z\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-目标差异公理\">6. 目标差异公理</h1>\n<p>KP+Infinity 只在纯成员语言中加入存在无穷集合公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Infinity}^{KPInf}=\\{\\exists I\\,\\operatorname{Inductive}(I)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Infinity}^{KPInf}=\\{\\exists I\\,\\operatorname{Inductive}(I)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令不含无穷公理的 KP 核心为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{KP}^{-\\mathrm{Inf}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Coll}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SetInd}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{KP}^{-\\mathrm{Inf}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Coll}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SetInd}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是完整的非逻辑公理与逻辑公理确切合并为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{KPInf}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}^{KPInf}_{Log}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{KP}^{-\\mathrm{Inf}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Infinity}^{KPInf}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{KPInf}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}^{KPInf}_{Log}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{KP}^{-\\mathrm{Inf}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Infinity}^{KPInf}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明系统\">7. 证明系统</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{KPInf}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{KPInf}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\)</span>，并且每行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma,\\qquad A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{KPInf},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in\\Gamma,\\qquad A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{KPInf},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ \\exists B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\ (A_k=(A_j\\to A_i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ \\exists B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf}\\ (A_k=(A_j\\to A_i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\,\n\\bigl(A_i=\\forall xA_j\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(C)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\,\n\\bigl(A_i=\\forall xA_j\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf}(C)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists j&lt;i\\ (A_j\\equiv_\\alpha^{KPInf}A_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists j&lt;i\\ (A_j\\equiv_\\alpha^{KPInf}A_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导关系与系统元组\">8. 可导关系与系统元组</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{KPInf}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{KPInf}A\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{KPInf}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{KPInf}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{KPInf}=\n(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf},\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},\\Delta_0^{KPInf},\n\\operatorname{Inductive},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{KPInf},\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}^{KPInf},\\operatorname{BV}_{KPInf},\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{T},\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{F},\n\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{KPInf},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{KPInf},\\equiv_\\alpha^{KPInf},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{KP}^{-\\mathrm{Inf}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{Infinity}^{KPInf},\\mathsf{Ax}_{KPInf},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{KPInf},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{KPInf},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{KPInf},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{KPInf},\n\\vdash_{KPInf}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{KPInf}=\n(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf},\\mathsf{Frm}_{KPInf},\\Delta_0^{KPInf},\n\\operatorname{Inductive},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{KPInf},\\operatorname{FV}_{KPInf},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}^{KPInf},\\operatorname{BV}_{KPInf},\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{T},\\operatorname{Sub}^{KPInf}_{F},\n\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{KPInf},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{KPInf},\\equiv_\\alpha^{KPInf},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{KP}^{-\\mathrm{Inf}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{Infinity}^{KPInf},\\mathsf{Ax}_{KPInf},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{KPInf},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{KPInf},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{KPInf},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{KPInf},\n\\vdash_{KPInf}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统不同于 KPω：它不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 作为常元，只断言某个归纳集存在；不含幂集、选择或完整替代。该系统只含句法对象、句法操作、公理集合、推理规则和证明关系；不含解释结构、语义满足、真值定义、模型类或元定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项、公式与结构操作","text":"2. 项、公式与结构操作","level":1},{"id":"有界量词的本地参数域","text":"有界量词的本地参数域","level":2},{"id":"本地宏接口与辅助绑定变量","text":"本地宏接口与辅助绑定变量","level":2},{"id":"3.-$\\Delta_0$-与无穷谓词","text":"3. $\\Delta_0$ 与无穷谓词","level":1},{"id":"4.-逻辑公理与规则关系","text":"4. 逻辑公理与规则关系","level":1},{"id":"5.-KP-部分公理","text":"5. KP 部分公理","level":1},{"id":"6.-目标差异公理","text":"6. 目标差异公理","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明系统","text":"7. 证明系统","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导关系与系统元组","text":"8. 可导关系与系统元组","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\doteq,\\quad \\in,\\quad \\neg,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\forall .","display":true},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Term}_{KPInf}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\math